// PE format - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// PE format: a Portable Executable, which is an MZ stub, a PE
// signature, a COFF header, an optional header and a section
// table. Four headers, and each one has a length field describing
// the one after it.
//
// The field worth knowing is e_lfanew at offset 0x3C: it is where
// the PE signature is. An MZ stub whose e_lfanew disagrees with the
// signature's actual position is a file every loader rejects, and
// it is indistinguishable from correct in a hex dump.
//
// Hello World! is the .text section's raw data.
//
// pe_format: 352 bytes, dumped sixteen at a time.
//
// The bytes below are not hand-written. They are built from the
// format's own field widths by scripts/build_object_formats.py, and
// scripts/verify_encodings.py reads the fields back by name -- the
// magic number, the lengths, the offsets. A hex dump written from
// memory is wrong in one byte and looks exactly like a correct one.
//

// 4D 5A 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |MZ..............|   <- 0000
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0010
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0020
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 40 00 00 00 |............@...|   <- 0030
// 50 45 00 00 4C 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |PE..L...........|   <- 0040
// 00 00 00 00 E0 00 02 01 0B 01 0E 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0050
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 10 00 00 |................|   <- 0060
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 40 00 00 10 00 00 00 02 00 00 |......@.........|   <- 0070
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0080
// 00 20 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 |. ..............|   <- 0090
// 10 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 10 00 00 |................|   <- 00A0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00B0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00C0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00D0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00E0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 00F0
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0100
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0110
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 |................|   <- 0120
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 2E 74 65 78 74 00 00 00 |.........text...|   <- 0130
// 0C 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 02 00 00 60 01 00 00 |............`...|   <- 0140
// 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 20 00 00 60 |............ ..`|   <- 0150
